What is an Open Hearth Electric Fireplace?
Open Hearth Electric Fireplaces mimic the classic architecture of a traditional open‑front hearth while employing LED or simulated‑flame technology to create a realistic burning effect. Unlike conventional wood‑burning fireplaces, these units feature an open front with little or no glass enclosure, prioritising visual ambience over maximal heating output. Pricing reflects a mid‑to‑low‑end positioning: entry‑level models range from $150–$400, mainstream units from $400–$900, and premium decorative or furniture‑integrated designs from $900–$1 500.
